 "format": 1,
 "version": "1.8.2",
 "min_shell": 1,
 "notes": [
  "Gemini answers show up as they're written, and never \"think forever\": if Google's newest Flash doesn't start in time, Vault switches to Flash-Lite; if neither answers, your message waits and sends itself later.",
  "Gemini on your PC too: pick Gemini in the Claude tab. (Claude's paid key stays with Jarvis.)",
  "Gemini keys that start with AQ. (the only kind Google makes now) work: Vault checks a key with Google when you save it.",
  "Dictation: tap the new mic in a note and talk \u2014 it types for you. Say \"comma\", \"period\" or \"new line\" for punctuation.",
  "Send to\u2026: under a Claude answer, send it to your Chromebook, PC or phone. It shows up there as a note a second later.",
  "Invite friends: on your PC, Settings > Invite people makes a one-time code. Your friend gets their own private Vault and picks their own password."
 ],
